    "summary": "During the opposing [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase), a move that leaves an enemy no farther than 8″ from **unengaged** Serberys Raiders triggers [Tactica Obliqua](vsdata:ability/adeptus-mechanicus.serberys-raiders.tactica-obliqua). The Raiders can travel up to D6″ as a **[Normal move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move)**, provided their entire unit finishes within 6″ of a friendly **ADEPTUS MECHANICUS BATTLELINE** unit.",
